1
00:04:24,545 --> 00:04:30,545
This holiday, discover your inner elf.

2
00:08:49,090 --> 00:08:55,090
Elf is a comedy, family, fantasy film directed by Jon Favreau.

3
00:13:13,636 --> 00:13:19,636
When young Buddy falls into Santa's gift sack on Christmas Eve, he's transported back
to the North Pole and raised as a toy-making elf by Santa's helpers.

4
00:17:38,181 --> 00:17:44,181
But as he grows into adulthood, he can't shake the
nagging feeling that he doesn't belong.

5
00:22:02,727 --> 00:22:08,727
Buddy vows to visit Manhattan and find his real dad, a workaholic.

6
00:26:27,272 --> 00:26:33,272
Buddy, played by Will Ferrell.

7
00:30:51,818 --> 00:30:57,818
Walter, played by James Caan.

8
00:35:16,363 --> 00:35:22,363
Papa Elf, played by Bob Newhart.

9
00:39:40,909 --> 00:39:46,909
Santa, played by Ed Asner.

10
00:44:05,454 --> 00:44:11,454
Emily, played by Mary Steenburgen.

11
00:48:30,000 --> 00:48:36,000
Jovie, played by Zooey Deschanel.

12
00:52:54,545 --> 00:53:00,545
Elf is a 2003 American Christmas comedy film directed by
Jon Favreau and written by David Berenbaum.

13
00:57:19,090 --> 00:57:25,090
It stars Will Ferrell as Buddy the Elf, a human raised by Santa's elves, who learns
about his origins and heads to New York City to meet his biological father.

14
01:01:43,636 --> 01:01:49,636
James Caan, Zooey Deschanel, Mary Steenburgen, Ed Asner
and Bob Newhart appear in supporting roles.

15
01:06:08,181 --> 01:06:14,181
Elf was released in the United States on November 7, 2003, by New Line Cinema.

16
01:10:32,727 --> 01:10:38,727
It became a major critical and commercial success, grossing $228.9
million worldwide against a $33 million budget.

17
01:14:57,272 --> 01:15:03,272
Ferrell's performance as Buddy, in particular, was praised by critics.

18
01:19:21,818 --> 01:19:27,818
The film inspired the 2010 Broadway musical Elf: The Musical and NBC's 2014 stop
motion animated television special Elf: Buddy's Musical Christmas.

19
01:23:46,363 --> 01:23:52,363
It has been hailed by many as a modern classic and is often listed
as one of the best Christmas films of all time.

20
01:28:10,909 --> 01:28:16,909
The film explores themes of elves, dwarf, holiday, adoption, santa claus.

21
01:32:35,454 --> 01:32:41,454
The tone is lighthearted.
